                "metadata": {
                    "author": "Yoto",
                    "category": "stories",
                    "seriestitle": "BrainBots: Our Planet",
                    "seriesorder": "3",
                    "description": "Take cover, everyone! The BrainBots are out of the classroom and exploring planet Earth to discover everything they can about earthquakes.  Join Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs as they travel inside the earth to look at the four layers that make it up - and pay close attention to the earth’s crust (not the pizza kind!). They’ll look at the earth’s plates, their faults and find out exactly what to do in an earthquake.  Kids can test their knowledge on everything they've learned with a special quiz. Don't forget to upload to the Brainbank!\n\n\nDiscover: Listen to the entire card for free! \nAvailable: Until the end of March. ",
